{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12655","headline":"系乐府十二首 农臣怨 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 农臣怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"农臣何所怨，乃欲干人主。\n不识天地心，徒然怨风雨。\n将论草木患，欲说昆虫苦。\n巡回宫阙傍，其意无由吐。\n一朝哭都市，泪尽归田亩。\n谣颂若采之，此言当可取。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12655.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12655","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}